            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Hercules Augustus, companion of our master, Aurelius Invictus Augustus. The community of Pisaurum [dedicated this] under the supervision of Gaius Iulius Priscianus, illustrious man, ducenarius, curator of the communities of Pisaurum and Fanum, and officer in charge of walls.</p>
